<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's NDL Corp first half net down.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's NDL Corp first half net down.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the first half ended December 31, 1996 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Income		  314 vs 250</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 78 vs 83</p>
<p>    Post-tax profit	63 vs 68</p>
<p>    Dividend		nil vs nil per 5-rupee share</p>
<p>    Bonus		   nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is National Development Leasing Corp . It is the largest leasing firm in Pakistan. The company has not announced any book closure as it has not announced any interim dividend. -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
